{"mode":"words","text":"Jetzt hörst du den Text und liest dabei mit. Als Anfänger liest du die Bedeutungszeile in deiner Muttersprache, hörst die Zielsprache langsam und drückst oft auf Pause — so verknüpft dein Kopf den Klang mit der Bedeutung. Als Fortgeschrittener liest du den Originaltext und schaust nur bei unbekannten Wörtern kurz nach unten. Nutze dabei oft die A-B-Wiederholung: Markiere einen einzelnen Satz und lass ihn in Schleife laufen — probiere es oben aus.","words":[{"s":0,"e":337},{"s":372,"e":615},{"s":639,"e":697},{"s":743,"e":848},{"s":894,"e":1254},{"s":1637,"e":1788},{"s":1846,"e":2055},{"s":2078,"e":2310},{"s":2357,"e":2705},{"s":3309,"e":3483},{"s":3564,"e":4052},{"s":4296,"e":4528},{"s":4551,"e":4609},{"s":4667,"e":4748},{"s":4783,"e":5677},{"s":5724,"e":5782},{"s":5817,"e":6026},{"s":6049,"e":6873},{"s":7082,"e":7314},{"s":7338,"e":7419},{"s":7477,"e":8162},{"s":8220,"e":8719},{"s":8928,"e":9079},{"s":9102,"e":9439},{"s":9532,"e":9811},{"s":9869,"e":9973},{"s":10054,"e":10496},{"s":10589,"e":10635},{"s":10809,"e":10937},{"s":10995,"e":11482},{"s":11506,"e":11645},{"s":11715,"e":12017},{"s":12086,"e":12202},{"s":12260,"e":12597},{"s":12922,"e":13085},{"s":13108,"e":13189},{"s":13224,"e":13886},{"s":14838,"e":14977},{"s":15035,"e":15778},{"s":15825,"e":16010},{"s":16034,"e":16092},{"s":16138,"e":16243},{"s":16301,"e":17090},{"s":17334,"e":17473},{"s":17496,"e":17798},{"s":17868,"e":18031},{"s":18077,"e":18170},{"s":18228,"e":18785},{"s":18832,"e":19180},{"s":19250,"e":19528},{"s":19586,"e":19726},{"s":19795,"e":20271},{"s":20968,"e":21258},{"s":21293,"e":21560},{"s":21630,"e":21908},{"s":22152,"e":22291},{"s":22349,"e":23394},{"s":23719,"e":24230},{"s":24277,"e":24509},{"s":24579,"e":25019},{"s":25077,"e":25379},{"s":25623,"e":25762},{"s":25809,"e":25983},{"s":26041,"e":26122},{"s":26169,"e":26215},{"s":26262,"e":26645},{"s":26679,"e":27051},{"s":27167,"e":27214},{"s":27423,"e":27829},{"s":27864,"e":27945},{"s":28026,"e":28212},{"s":28258,"e":2